Z||000004||Old Lar||12-30-2001||01:39 PM||||After 5 years of sitting and last start up two years ago, plan for some maintenance.  Changing all the fluids: coolant, oil, transmission, brake.  Look carefully at the  E-brake cable, most likely frozen.  A full tune up should be a must.||||reg||1
